{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"裸足でsummerの個別握手会が始まりましたよー！！むしろ まだだった不思議。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで 写真載せるね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな 会いに来てくれてありがとうーっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『Without haste, but without rest.』のTシャツがあったようで ブログ見て友達が誕生日にくれました。ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/09/25/0989718/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんぐりヘアにしてみた。好評嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんぐりの周りを走り回る ニャンちゅう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/09/25/0989718/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/09/25/0989718/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんぐり遊ばれる。むみ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/09/25/0989718/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月29日に初日迎えます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嫌われ松子の一生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤い熱情篇&黒い孤独篇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちもよろしく！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/09/25/0989718/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰よりも私達の味方でいて欲しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援よろしくお願いします。"}],"source":"archive"}